<title>UK: TENNIS-NOTTINGHAM OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NOTTINGHAM OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NOTTINGHAM, England 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results</p>
<p>at the Nottingham Open men's tennis tournament on Monday (prefix</p>
<p>denotes seed):</p>
<p>Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat Jeff Tarango (U.S.) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Richard Fromberg (Australia) beat Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) 3-6</p>
<p>6-3 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) beat 2-Marcelo Rios (Chile)</p>
<p>6-4 6-2</p>
<p>5-Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) beat Magnus Norman (Sweden) 6-0</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>4-Tim Henman (Britain) beat Andrew Richardson (Britain) 6-3 6-7</p>
<p>(6-8) 6-4.</p>
</text>
